ibri, sans-serif;'><a href='https://manitoba.maps.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=420d169c9349437789d202b302bc2732&amp;view=table&amp;sortOrder=desc&amp;sortField=defaultFSOrder#overview' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='font-size:11.5pt; font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;'>services de conditionnement à forfait du\nManitoba</span></a></span><span style='font-size:11pt; font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif;'> et fait partie de l’</span><span style='font-size:11pt; font-family:Calibri, sans-serif;'><a href='https://manitoba.maps.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=52777a863b0b4ff7b3f5b4079af24799' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'><span style='font-family:&quot;Helvetica&quot;,sans-serif;'>appli des services de\nconditionnement à forfait du Manitoba</span></a></span><span style='font-size:11pt; font-family:Helvetica, sans-serif;'>.</span></p>"
